@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Plan
+
+1. Change the customer-scoped admin endpoint to build an order criterion from the requested customer id, with page/count semantics, and make customer enrichment optional. Return an empty response with zero totals when that id has no orders.
+2. Make single-order customer enrichment tolerant of a deleted account so normal order population still returns the saved billing, delivery, email, status, history, and payment-related order data.
+3. Preserve repository `recordsTotal` and `totalPages` when converting admin order pages, including empty and out-of-range pages; ensure the page count uses mathematical ceiling and page indexing starts at zero.
+4. Add or update focused tests for deleted-customer order access, customer-id listing, account re-registration isolation, filtered admin pagination, and empty/out-of-range results.
+5. Run the relevant module tests and a Maven build, then inspect the resulting diff and report any verification limits.
